# Cloudflare-hosted FE -> API served over the idx-tunnel cloudflared tunnel.
# URLs must be ABSOLUTE: a relative /api resolves to the Cloudflare static site,
# whose POST handler returns 405 (that was the build/generate failure).
#
# WARNING: this is a QUICK cloudflared tunnel (*.trycloudflare.com). Its hostname
# changes if the idx-tunnel container restarts. If the board or the builder breaks
# after a restart, read the new URL from `docker logs idx-tunnel`, update these
# three lines, then rebuild + `npx wrangler deploy`. For a stable hostname, move
# idx-tunnel to a named Cloudflare tunnel.
VITE_API_URL=https://entertaining-ooo-consist-tribe.trycloudflare.com/api
VITE_GENERATE_URL=https://entertaining-ooo-consist-tribe.trycloudflare.com/api/generate
VITE_BUILD_URL=https://entertaining-ooo-consist-tribe.trycloudflare.com/api/build
VITE_REBALANCE_URL=https://entertaining-ooo-consist-tribe.trycloudflare.com/api/rebalance-strategy
